	"title"		"soccer_2v2_arena"
	"description"		"[h1]soccer_2v2_arena[/h1]
A small sports hall for CS2 SoccerMod, made for two against two: street football in a cage, on a wooden floor.

[h2]What it is[/h2]
[list]
[*] A parquet court of 1040 x 1440 units; the end walls and the cage are in play - the ball never leaves the court
[*] A cage on the long sides: kick boards, steel mesh and a net up to the beams, a net under the ceiling
[*] Small hall goals set into the end walls
[*] The painted lines of a real school hall, the goal areas in the teams' colours, an emblem in the centre circle
[*] Fans standing right behind the cage on both sides
[*] Timber beams, LED panels, a window band, wall bars, basketball boards, a scoreboard and team banners
[*] Working radar
[/list]

[h2]Made for SoccerMod[/h2]
Kicking, goals and matches come from the CS2 SoccerMod server plugin: [url=https://github.com/Deidakom/CS2_Soccer_Mod]github.com/Deidakom/CS2_Soccer_Mod[/url]. Servers load the SoccerMod item [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3811382872]soccer_soccermod_arena[/url] next to this map; it carries everything the plugin shows and plays. Without the plugin the map loads, but the ball is only a physics prop.

[h2]Patch notes[/h2]
[b]2026-10-02[/b] First version.
"
	"changenote"		"First version."
